4. Assembly generation.
Clean reads were assembled into contiguous sequences with Flye v2.9.3 producing draft assemblies (Kolmogorov et al., 2019) https://github.com/fenderglass/Flye 

Installing flye:

git clone https://github.com/fenderglass/Flye

Then create the assemblies with the following command, this is an example of an actual sample. 
flye --nano-hq barcode07/*fastq --out-dir flye_assembly07 --genome-size 40m --threads 15 flye --nano-hq barcode12/*fastq --out-dir flye_assembly12 --genome-size 40m --threads 15

