(https://www.geneious.com) Geneious was used as a software to explore both the genomes and in comparison to the reference genome, corroborating the results provided by VEP. Annotations from GenBank under Bioproject number PRJNA348385 were downloaded to enable the comparison of the VCF file containing the SVs of both genomes. Individual inspection of each SV was performed with Geneious software.

